From 1ff6d7905117cbf277bdab2d0c16663c4cd4ee94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vamsi <vamsi@jvunique.local>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 07:38:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UI cleanup: remove Space from bottom nav, simplify sidebar
 Quick Mood, add global default avatar fallback

- Bottom nav: removed Space item only (still fully accessible via sidebar/My Space)
- Sidebar Quick Mood: reduced from 6 moods to Happy/Sad/Angry, mood-update flow untouched
- Avatar system: centralized default silhouette fallback (setAvText/setAvImg in index.html,
  avatar-system.js, chat/call.js, games.html, livemap.js) with image-load-error handling,
  replacing inconsistent initials/blank/broken-image states. Notification icon logic (sw.js)
  and Watch Together in-call camera-off placeholder left untouched.
